From 5bdded41928fc1c929492196a5b6d802b29dd07b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:34:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: retire superseded -lotusv2node sidecar and peer_*
 prototypes

Deletes the superseded -lotusv2node development sidecar mini-daemon
(development_node_command.*, peer_tcp.*, peer_session.*, peer_dispatcher.*,
peer_download.*, peer_transport.*, peer_codec.*, and sidecar-only
transaction_relay / avalanche_peer / avalanche_driver / avalanche_provision
adapters and tests) now that the native ABC + Chronik daemon is wired and
verified.
